<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Project>
    <PropertyGroup>
        <Version>3.5.11</Version>
        <Notes>
            - Change global.json to use .NET 11.0 SDK (also update the github workflow to use .NET 11.0 SDK)
            - Update Target Frameworks for core library SvgNet and unit tests project SvgNetUnitTests to include .NET 11.0 and .NET 11.0-windows
            - Update Dependency
            + Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk "18.11.0" -> "18.11.1"
            + System.Drawing.Common "10.0.14" -> "11.0.0" (only when building for .NET 10.0 or .NET 11.0)
            - Separate class SvgImageElement to its own file SvgImageElement.cs
            - Small optimizations in SvgColor.cs: use Regex.IsMatch(s) instead of Regex.Match(s).Success in two places
            - Change routine.bash to expand the aliases it was conditionally using to avoid dependency on the aliases being defined in the shell environment
        </Notes>
        <LangVersion>preview</LangVersion>
    </PropertyGroup>
</Project>